{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主的仆人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，我所扶持、所拣选、所喜悦的仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已将我的灵赐给祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必将正义带给万邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不喧嚷，不呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不在街上高声说话。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"压伤的芦苇，祂不折断；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将残的灯火，祂不吹灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必信实地带来正义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不灰心也不沮丧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到祂在地上设立正义。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众海岛都仰望祂的训诲。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"创造诸天、铺展穹苍、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铺设大地和地上的一切、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐给世人生命气息的耶和华上帝说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我耶和华凭公义呼召你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必扶持你，保护你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你做我与众民立约的中保、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成为列国的光，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你开盲人的眼睛、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从监牢中释放囚犯、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领出坐在黑暗中的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和华，这就是我的名字。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不会把我的荣耀给假神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会把我当受的赞美给雕刻的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，以前的预言都已应验，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我现在要宣告新的预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把还未发生的事告诉你们。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["赞美主的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"航海的和海中的一切、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众海岛和岛上的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要向耶和华高唱新歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从地极赞美祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旷野和其中的城邑以及基达人居住的村庄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要一同扬声颂赞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西拉的居民要歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在山顶欢呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要把荣耀归给耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在众海岛上颂赞祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华像出征的勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像斗志激昂的战士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必高呼呐喊，战胜仇敌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝应许帮助以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“我已沉默多时，我克制不语，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在我要像分娩的妇人一样喊叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"气喘吁吁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使大山小丘一片荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上面的草木都枯萎。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使河川变成岛屿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"池塘干涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要带领盲人走他们不认识的路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引导他们走陌生的道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把他们面前的黑暗变为光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坎坷之地变得平坦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必行这些事，我必不离弃他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但那些信靠雕刻的偶像、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供奉金属铸像的必败退，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞愧难当。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列眼瞎耳聋"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“耳聋的人啊，听吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼瞎的人啊，看吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有谁比我的仆人更瞎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比我差遣的使者更聋呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有谁像那些与我立约的人那样瞎呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有谁像耶和华的仆人那样瞎呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们看见许多事却不领会，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵开着却听不见。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华乐意使祂的律法尊大荣耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好彰显祂的公义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但这些百姓饱受劫掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都被困在坑中，囚在监内。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们沦为俘虏，无人搭救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被当作战利品掳走，无人追回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们当中谁肯专心听呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以后谁肯留心倾听呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁把雅各交给了掳掠者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列任人劫掠？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不是我们得罪的耶和华吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们不肯遵行祂的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不听从祂的训诲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，祂把烈怒和战火倾倒在他们身上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们被火包围，却不明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被烈火焚身，却不在乎。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}